; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M5 (tick replay): Candles trailing (TrailMode 6), setup 1 of 3: sell, session 0700-2000 server time, trend filter H1 EMA 200, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
